designer_notes = "PLACEHOLDER (PROGRESS 110, 2026-11-18, Luke: \"map everything to placeholder abilities and I'll try them in action\"): a motion lab move (game/regents/motion/) on a placeholder built from existing atoms, to try as a prototype. Its name, numbers and what it really does are Luke's. Sword, plain grip, an E option: a hop into an overhead strike (leaping_strike.tres); the body's travel is the lunge's dash, fired as the hop comes down."
